docs {
  # FlyNG API Collection

  Warehouse Drone Management System API

  ## Structure
  - v1/users/ - User Management APIs
    - auth/ - Authentication (login, register, logout)
    - profile/ - Profile & Password management
    - otp/ - OTP verification & password reset
    - 2fa/ - Two-Factor Authentication
    - sessions/ - Session management
    - email/ - Email change
    - admin/ - Admin/Manager endpoints
}
